    {
      "use": "update",
      "label": "starting totals",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "score",
            "value": {
              "calc": "starting_points"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "exact_interceptions",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "exact_decodes",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "red_points",
            "value": {
              "calc": "starting_points"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "blue_points",
            "value": {
              "calc": "starting_points"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "history",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "round",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "sync",
      "label": "the table",
      "mode": "self",
      "to": "all",
      "fields": [
        "team",
        "keywords",
        "score",
        "exact_interceptions",
        "exact_decodes"
      ],
      "text": "You start with (your team's keywords are numbered 1-4 in order):"
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "roles",
      "label": "roles and resets",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat in [1, 3]"
            },
            "key": "role",
            "value": {
              "calc": "'Encryptor' if round % 2 == 1 else 'Decoder'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat in [2, 4]"
            },
            "key": "role",
            "value": {
              "calc": "'Decoder' if round % 2 == 1 else 'Encryptor'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "red_enc",
            "value": {
              "calc": "min([p.seat for p in players if p.team == 'Red' and p.role == 'Encryptor'])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "blue_enc",
            "value": {
              "calc": "min([p.seat for p in players if p.team == 'Blue' and p.role == 'Encryptor'])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "red_dec",
            "value": {
              "calc": "min([p.seat for p in players if p.team == 'Red' and p.role == 'Decoder'])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "blue_dec",
            "value": {
              "calc": "min([p.seat for p in players if p.team == 'Blue' and p.role == 'Decoder'])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "red_invalid",
            "value": false
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "blue_invalid",
            "value": false
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "red_valid",
            "value": false
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "blue_valid",
            "value": false
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "red_gain",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "blue_gain",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "guess",
            "value": ""
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "roles",
      "label": "roles announced",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Round {round}: the Encryptors are seats {red_enc} (Red) and {blue_enc} (Blue); the Decoders are seats {red_dec} (Red) and {blue_dec} (Blue)."
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "encrypt",
      "label": "red code choice",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == red_enc"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "game": "codes"
        }
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "red_code_ans"
      },
      "text": "You are Red's Encryptor this round. Secretly choose Red's code: three different digits from 1-4, in order. Nobody else sees it, not even your teammate."
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "encrypt",
      "label": "blue code choice",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == blue_enc"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "game": "codes"
        }
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "blue_code_ans"
      },
      "text": "You are Blue's Encryptor this round. Secretly choose Blue's code: three different digits from 1-4, in order. Nobody else sees it, not even your teammate."
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "encrypt",
      "label": "red clues",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == red_enc"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "text",
        "max_words": 12
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "red_clue_ans"
      },
      "text": "Your code is {red_code_ans}. Write three clues separated by commas: clue 1 for your keyword numbered by the code's first digit, clue 2 for the second digit, clue 3 for the third. Each clue must be a single word with no spaces, {clue_min_letters}-{clue_max_letters} letters, must not contain or be contained in any of your team's keywords (ignoring case), and must not repeat any clue from an earlier round (see history). Any invalid clue marks your team invalid: you score no decode points and Blue gains {invalid_penalty_points}."
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "encrypt",
      "label": "blue clues",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == blue_enc"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "text",
        "max_words": 12
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "blue_clue_ans"
      },
      "text": "Your code is {blue_code_ans}. Write three clues separated by commas: clue 1 for your keyword numbered by the code's first digit, clue 2 for the second digit, clue 3 for the third. Each clue must be a single word with no spaces, {clue_min_letters}-{clue_max_letters} letters, must not contain or be contained in any of your team's keywords (ignoring case), and must not repeat any clue from an earlier round (see history). Any invalid clue marks your team invalid: you score no decode points and Red gains {invalid_penalty_points}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "encrypt",
      "label": "record codes and clues",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "red_code",
            "value": "$red_code_ans"
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "blue_code",
            "value": "$blue_code_ans"
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "red_clues",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[$red_clue_ans]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "blue_clues",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[$blue_clue_ans]"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "check",
      "label": "red clue check",
      "when": {
        "prose": "Each of Red's three clues this round is a single word with no spaces, 2 to 20 letters long, does not contain (ignoring case) any of Red's four keywords and is not contained in any of them, and is not identical (ignoring case) to any clue in history."
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "red_valid",
            "value": true
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "check",
      "label": "blue clue check",
      "when": {
        "prose": "Each of Blue's three clues this round is a single word with no spaces, 2 to 20 letters long, does not contain (ignoring case) any of Blue's four keywords and is not contained in any of them, and is not identical (ignoring case) to any clue in history."
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "blue_valid",
            "value": true
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "clues",
      "label": "clues shown",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Red clues: {red_clues}. Blue clues: {blue_clues}."
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "guess",
      "label": "guesses",
      "to": "acting",
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "game": "codes"
        }
      },
      "store": "guess",
      "text": "Choose one code. If you are a Decoder, it is your decode of your own team's clues. If you are an Encryptor, it is your interception of the opposing team's clues (interceptions score nothing in round 1)."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "score",
      "label": "decode scoring",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "red_invalid",
            "value": {
              "calc": "not red_valid"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "blue_invalid",
            "value": {
              "calc": "not blue_valid"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "last_guesses",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[p.guess for p in players]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "red_g",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[p.guess for p in players if p.seat == red_dec][0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "blue_g",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[p.guess for p in players if p.seat == blue_dec][0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "red_match",
            "value": {
              "calc": "count(red_g[i] == red_code[i] for i in [0, 1, 2]) if len(red_g) == code_length and len(red_code) == code_length else 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "blue_match",
            "value": {
              "calc": "count(blue_g[i] == blue_code[i] for i in [0, 1, 2]) if len(blue_g) == code_length and len(blue_code) == code_length else 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "red_gain",
            "value": {
              "calc": "red_match * decode_points_per_position"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "not red_invalid"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "red_gain",
            "value": {
              "calc": "exact_decode_bonus_points"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "not red_invalid and red_match == code_length"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat in [1, 2]"
            },
            "key": "exact_decodes",
            "value": {
              "calc": "exact_decode_count_gain"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "not red_invalid and red_match == code_length"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "blue_gain",
            "value": {
              "calc": "blue_match * decode_points_per_position"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "not blue_invalid"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "blue_gain",
            "value": {
              "calc": "exact_decode_bonus_points"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "not blue_invalid and blue_match == code_length"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat in [3, 4]"
            },
            "key": "exact_decodes",
            "value": {
              "calc": "exact_decode_count_gain"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "not blue_invalid and blue_match == code_length"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "score",
      "label": "interception scoring",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round >= first_scoring_interception_round"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "red_g",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[p.guess for p in players if p.seat == red_enc][0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "blue_g",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[p.guess for p in players if p.seat == blue_enc][0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "red_match",
            "value": {
              "calc": "count(red_g[i] == blue_code[i] for i in [0, 1, 2]) if len(red_g) == code_length and len(blue_code) == code_length else 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "blue_match",
            "value": {
              "calc": "count(blue_g[i] == red_code[i] for i in [0, 1, 2]) if len(blue_g) == code_length and len(red_code) == code_length else 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "red_gain",
            "value": {
              "calc": "red_match * intercept_points_per_position + (exact_intercept_bonus_points if red_match == code_length else 0)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat in [1, 2]"
            },
            "key": "exact_interceptions",
            "value": {
              "calc": "exact_intercept_count_gain"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "red_match == code_length"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "blue_gain",
            "value": {
              "calc": "blue_match * intercept_points_per_position + (exact_intercept_bonus_points if blue_match == code_length else 0)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat in [3, 4]"
            },
            "key": "exact_interceptions",
            "value": {
              "calc": "exact_intercept_count_gain"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "blue_match == code_length"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "score",
      "label": "penalty and totals",
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "blue_gain",
            "value": {
              "calc": "invalid_penalty_points"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "red_invalid"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "red_gain",
            "value": {
              "calc": "invalid_penalty_points"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "blue_invalid"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "red_points",
            "value": {
              "calc": "red_gain"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "blue_points",
            "value": {
              "calc": "blue_gain"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat in [1, 2]"
            },
            "key": "score",
            "value": {
              "calc": "red_points"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat in [3, 4]"
            },
            "key": "score",
            "value": {
              "calc": "blue_points"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "score",
      "label": "history",
      "do": [
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "history",
            "value": {
              "calc": "['Round', round, 'Red clues', red_clues, 'code', red_code, 'Blue clues', blue_clues, 'code', blue_code]"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "score",
      "label": "the reveal",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Red's code was {red_code}, Blue's was {blue_code}. Guesses (seats 1, 2, 3, 4): {last_guesses}. Red invalid: {red_invalid}; Blue invalid: {blue_invalid}. Red gained {red_gain} (total {red_points}); Blue gained {blue_gain} (total {blue_points})."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "score",
      "label": "next round",
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "round",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "score",
      "label": "after round 8",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round > rounds"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "over": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "round > rounds"
      },
      "rank_by": "you.score * 10000 + you.exact_interceptions * 100 + you.exact_decodes",
      "text": "Winner: {result}. Red (seats 1-2): {red_points} points, {players[0].exact_interceptions} exact interceptions, {players[0].exact_decodes} exact decodes; Blue (seats 3-4): {blue_points} points, {players[2].exact_interceptions} exact interceptions, {players[2].exact_decodes} exact decodes."
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "rounds": 8,
    "rounds_max": 8,
    "actions_max": 1000,
    "deadline_s": 120
  },
  "rules": "Four players: seats 1 and 2 form team Red, seats 3 and 4 form team Blue. Eight distinct keywords are drawn at random from a fixed list of {keyword_list_size} common nouns. The first four go to Red, numbered 1-4; the next four go to Blue, numbered 1-4. Each team's keywords are shown only to that team's two players. Each team starts with {starting_points} points, 0 exact interceptions and 0 exact decodes. A public history lists, for each team and each past round, its three clues and its revealed true code.\n\nCODES. A code is three different digits from 1-4 in order. There are {code_count} codes, offered in this order: 123, 124, 132, 134, 142, 143, 213, 214, 231, 234, 241, 243, 312, 314, 321, 324, 341, 342, 412, 413, 421, 423, 431, 432.\n\nROLES. In odd rounds, seats 1 and 3 are Encryptors and seats 2 and 4 are Decoders. In even rounds, the roles swap.\n\nEACH ROUND ({rounds} rounds):\n1. Roles for the round are announced.\n2. Code choice (simultaneous, secret): each Encryptor chooses one of the 24 codes for their team. No one else sees it, not even the teammate.\n3. Clues (simultaneous): each Encryptor writes three clues, separated by commas, one per digit of the code in order. Clue 1 should point to the team keyword numbered by the first digit, and so on.\n4. Clue check. A clue is valid only if all of these hold: it is a single word with no spaces; it is {clue_min_letters}-{clue_max_letters} letters long; ignoring case, it does not contain any of the team's own four keywords and is not contained in any of them; it is not identical, ignoring case, to any clue either team has given in an earlier round. A team with any invalid clue this round is marked invalid; a team whose clues are all valid is not.\n5. All six clues are shown to everyone.\n6. Guesses (simultaneous): each Decoder chooses one of the 24 codes as a decode of their own team's clues. Each Encryptor chooses one of the 24 codes as an interception of the opposing team's clues.\n7. Decode scoring, for each team that is not invalid: the team gains {decode_points_per_position} point for each position (first, second, third) where the Decoder's guess matches the team's true code. If all three match, the team gains {exact_decode_bonus_points} more point and 1 exact decode. A team marked invalid gains 0 decode points this round, even if its Decoder's guess is correct.\n8. Interception scoring, rounds {first_scoring_interception_round}-{rounds} only: each team gains {intercept_points_per_position} point for each position where its Encryptor's interception matches the opposing team's true code. If all three match, the team gains {exact_intercept_bonus_points} more points and 1 exact interception. In round 1 interceptions score nothing.\n9. Invalid penalty: if a team is marked invalid, the opposing team gains {invalid_penalty_points} points; if it is not, nobody gains a penalty.\n10. Both true codes, all guesses and all points gained are announced, and the clues and codes are added to the public history.\n\nNo other talk is allowed. The clues are the only communication. Both players of a team always share the same score, exact interceptions and exact decodes.\n\nEND. After round {rounds} the game ends. The team with more points after round {rounds} wins, and both of its players win. If points are tied, the team with more exact interceptions wins. If still tied, the team with more exact decodes wins. If still tied, the game is a draw and all four players share the result."
}
